-- חוזר לבעלויות תש"פ/12 (25.8.2020): תגמול עובדי הוראה בגין הישגי בית הספר
-- לשנת הלימודים תש"ף.
-- The one-off grant to upper-secondary teachers of the schools ranked
-- highest for achievement in תש"ף (§36 of the agreement of 14.8.2011):
-- amounts by the school's rank, pro-rating, payment and its treatment.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `תש"פ/12 תגמול עובדי הוראה בגין הישגי בית הספר לשנת הלימודים תש"ף`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, date, reference number, addressee, greeting and subject line; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p13 akn:preamble/p14 The recital of the general collective agreement of 14.8.2011 with the Secondary School Teachers' Association and what it covers; no rule of its own.

-- ¶15: the circular publishes the instructions on the achievement grant for
-- תש"ף to teachers employed that year by the owners of post-primary education
-- in the upper-secondary divisions, under §36 of the agreement.
@ref akn:preamble/p15
`the school year of the grant` MEANS "תש\"ף"

DECLARE `achievement action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the achievement grant` HAS `amount paid` IS A NUMBER
    `reimburse the owner under payments topic 583`

@desc An upper-secondary teacher's year, as far as the achievement grant asks.
DECLARE `achievement teacher` HAS
    `graded on the teaching-employee scale`                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `employed in upper secondary by a supervised owner`         IS A BOOLEAN
    `rank of the school`                                        IS A NUMBER  @desc 1 to 4 for the four deciles the Ministry found highest (section 2(ב)); 0 for any other school
    `upper-secondary position fraction`                         IS A NUMBER  @desc the share of a full position held in the upper-secondary division of the winning school
    `share of the year employed at the school`                  IS A NUMBER  @desc the part of תש"ף employed at the winning school, maternity leave under the Women's Employment Law counted as employed
    `on full sabbatical or unpaid leave all year`               IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `1 Applicability`

-- §1: every employee on the teaching scale in the upper-secondary division
-- employed by a supervised post-primary owner, by the share of employment in
-- that division, whether or not under Oz LeTmura.
@ref akn:art_1/p1 akn:art_1/p2
GIVEN t IS AN `achievement teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the circular applies to` t IF
        t's `graded on the teaching-employee scale`
    AND t's `employed in upper secondary by a supervised owner`

§§ `2 The achievement grant`

-- §2(א): the programme, in grades 9–12/14 (four-year school) or 10–12/14
-- (three- or six-year school), runs since תשע"ג by the format and rules of the
-- pedagogical administration's letter of 21.10.2012 — an input here.
@ref akn:art_2__para_a/p1
@desc Whether the Ministry ranked the school under the rules of the letter of 21.10.2012; not printed in this circular.
ASSUME `ranked under the letter of 21.10.2012` IS A BOOLEAN

-- §2(ב)'s table AS PRINTED: the school's rank (each a further 10%) and the
-- grant for a full position, updated to May 2020 by the consumer price index
-- (May 2020 against May 2019).
@ref akn:art_2__para_b/p1 akn:art_2__para_b/p2 akn:art_2__para_b/p3 akn:art_2__para_b/p4 akn:art_2__para_b/p5 akn:art_2__para_b/p6 akn:art_2__para_b/p7 akn:art_2__para_b/p8 akn:art_2__para_b/p9 akn:art_2__para_b/p10 akn:art_2__para_b/p11 akn:art_2__para_b/p12
GIVEN rank IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the grant for a full position` rank IS
    CONSIDER rank
    WHEN 1 THEN 8318.22
    WHEN 2 THEN 6238.66
    WHEN 3 THEN 4159.11
    WHEN 4 THEN 3119.33
    OTHERWISE 0

-- §2(ג): a part position and/or part of the year gets the proportional part —
-- by the upper-secondary position AND by the part of the year — unpaid
-- leave and sabbatical reducing it, maternity leave not (unpaid leave after
-- it does). A full year of sabbatical or unpaid leave earns nothing.
-- §2(ד): employment beyond 100% is not counted.
@ref akn:art_2__para_c/p1 akn:art_2__para_c/p2 akn:art_2__para_c/p3 akn:art_2__para_d/p1
@export The one-off achievement grant for תש"ף an upper-secondary teacher is paid under circular תש"פ/12
GIVEN t IS AN `achievement teacher` @desc the teacher's year
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the achievement grant` t IS
    IF `the circular applies to` t AND (NOT t's `on full sabbatical or unpaid leave all year`)
    THEN `the grant for a full position` (t's `rank of the school`)
         TIMES min (t's `upper-secondary position fraction`) 1
         TIMES t's `share of the year employed at the school`
    ELSE 0

-- §2(ו): the grants are not part of the base for the hour value, severance
-- or percentage supplements, and no study-fund contribution is made on them.
@ref akn:art_2__para_f/p1
DECLARE `pay base` IS ONE OF
    `the hour value`
    `severance pay`
    `percentage supplements`
    `study-fund contributions`

GIVEN b IS A `pay base`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the grant is left out of` b IF
    elem b (LIST `the hour value`, `severance pay`, `percentage supplements`, `study-fund contributions`)

-- §2(ז): pension contributions of 5% from the employer and 5% deducted from
-- the teacher.
@ref akn:art_2__para_g/p1
GIVEN grant IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the employer's pension contribution on the grant` grant IS grant TIMES 0.05

GIVEN grant IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the teacher's pension deduction on the grant` grant IS grant TIMES 0.05

-- §2(ה): paid with August 2020's salary and no later than September 2020's.
-- Time in months from August 2020's salary (August = 0).
@ref akn:art_2__para_e/p1
GIVEN t IS AN `achievement teacher`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `achievement action`
DECIDE `paying the achievement grant` t IS
    IF `the achievement grant` t GREATER THAN 0
    THEN PARTY `the employer`
         MUST  `pay the achievement grant` `amount paid`
               PROVIDED `amount paid` AT LEAST `the achievement grant` t
         WITHIN 1
         LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "תש\"פ/12 §2(ה): the grant is paid with August's salary and no later than September 2020's"
    ELSE FULFILLED

§§ `3–4 The list of schools and the reimbursement`

-- §3: the list of winning schools is given by a link, not printed; whether a
-- school is on it is the rank input.
@ref akn:art_3/p1
GIVEN t IS AN `achievement teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the school is on the list of winners` t IF
    t's `rank of the school` AT LEAST 1 AND t's `rank of the school` AT MOST 4

-- §4: the owners are reimbursed under payments topic 583, in the August 2020
-- payments transferred at the start of September 2020 (month 1 here).
@ref akn:art_4/p1
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `achievement action`
DECIDE `reimbursing the owners` IS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `reimburse the owner under payments topic 583`
    WITHIN 1
    LEST BREACH BY `the Ministry of Education` BECAUSE "תש\"פ/12 §4: reimbursement under topic 583 in the payments transferred at the start of 9/2020"

-- akn:conclusions The contact line for questions, the sign-off and signatures; no rule.

§§ `Worked examples`

GIVEN rank IS A NUMBER, f IS A NUMBER, share IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `achievement teacher`
DECIDE `a teacher` rank f share IS
    `achievement teacher` WITH
        `graded on the teaching-employee scale`             IS TRUE
        `employed in upper secondary by a supervised owner` IS TRUE
        `rank of the school`                                IS rank
        `upper-secondary position fraction`                 IS f
        `share of the year employed at the school`          IS share
        `on full sabbatical or unpaid leave all year`       IS FALSE

#ASSERT `the achievement grant` (`a teacher` 1 1 1) EQUALS 8318.22
#ASSERT `the achievement grant` (`a teacher` 3 0.5 1) EQUALS 2079.555
#ASSERT `the achievement grant` (`a teacher` 2 1.3 0.5) EQUALS 3119.33
#ASSERT `the achievement grant` (`a teacher` 0 1 1) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the employer's pension contribution on the grant` 8318.22 EQUALS 415.911
#ASSERT `the grant is left out of` `severance pay`
#ASSERT `the school is on the list of winners` (`a teacher` 4 1 1)

-- The four amounts stand at 1 : 0.75 : 0.5 : 0.375 of the top rank's, each
-- printed at or under one agora below the exact product (6,238.665 is
-- printed 6,238.66, 3,119.3325 as 3,119.33).
GIVEN rank IS A NUMBER, ratio IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `printed within an agora below` rank ratio IF
        `the grant for a full position` rank AT MOST `the grant for a full position` 1 TIMES ratio
    AND `the grant for a full position` rank GREATER THAN `the grant for a full position` 1 TIMES ratio MINUS 0.01

#ASSERT `printed within an agora below` 2 0.75
#ASSERT `printed within an agora below` 3 0.5
#ASSERT `printed within an agora below` 4 0.375

#TRACE `paying the achievement grant` (`a teacher` 1 1 1) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the achievement grant` 8318.22 AT 1
#TRACE `paying the achievement grant` (`a teacher` 1 1 1) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the achievement grant` 8318.22 AT 2
